{
    "title": "My Collection: Comic Scanner",
    "description": "HipComic's My Collection is the fastest way to organize and value your comic book collection. With just a snap of a photo from your phone or tablet, HipComic's My Collection will automatically detect the Volume and Issue Number, provide a guide value, and add your comic to your collection.\r\n\r\nSnap A Picture Of Your Comics\r\nMy Collection\u2019s exclusive image recognition technology instantly recognizes your comic. No barcodes required. \r\n\r\nValue Your Collection\r\nManage and value your entire comic book collection in one place, both on the web and on your phone or tablet. \r\n\r\nCompletely Free\r\nEnjoy full access to all features and unlimited scans at no cost. No scan limits or features are locked behind paid tiers.",
